0..76 Comment "// Records: a literal by label or shorthand, a pattern punning or renaming a"
77..113 Comment "// field, a field selected by label."
114..116 Comment "//"
117..194 Comment "// A record\'s fields are read by label, so the order a literal writes them in"
195..267 Comment "// changes nothing. A wider record stands where a narrower one is asked."
268..270 Comment "//"
271..349 Comment "// Each `runs` row states the record or the field the program answers, and the"
350..408 Comment "// printer writes a record back in its type\'s field order."
409..411 Comment "//"
